      </li>
      <li style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Select the lower earner's planned claiming age.</strong> Choose any age from 62 to 70 to see how early claiming reductions affect the monthly check.
      </li>
      <li style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Confirm primary earner filing status.</strong> Indicate whether the primary earner has already filed or will file on time. Remember that currently married spouses cannot receive spousal top-ups until the primary earner files.
