      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Linda’s husband has a PIA of $2,400. Linda has no personal Social Security earnings record. She decides to claim spousal benefits early at age 62.
      </p>
      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <tbody>
          <tr style="background: #e8f4f1;">
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D2137;">Input</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D2137;">Value</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Husband's PIA</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$2,400 / month</td>
